  "prompt": {
    "positive": "A seamless-looking square flat-lay albedo texture of original stylized fantasy stone paving. Large readable hand-painted stone slabs and irregular cobbles with confident simplified shapes. Stylized blue-gray palette with restrained warm grey and pale stone variation. Low photographic noise and a clean painterly surface with subtle brush and chisel marks. Orthographic top-down albedo appearance with flat even illumination, no cast shadows and no perspective. Stone pattern fills the frame edge to edge with no border, frame, text, logo or watermark. Mid-frequency wear follows stone edges and contact points rather than uniform photographic grain. Original ruined-waystation stonework culture, not a copy of an existing game or recognizable asset. Intended Roblox use: Repeating floor surface in an original fantasy exploration game; flat albedo material only. Style direction: Adventure Fantasy. Weathered stone, woven fiber and oxidized metal with restrained hand-shaped variation. Surface detail rule: Mid-frequency wear follows edges and contact points, never uniform noise. Palette anchored in deep teal (#314D50), warm stone grey (#887B69), pale sand (#D5B888), with teal (#80B8AA) and orange (#D69B5C) accents. Lighting and material response: Warm directional sun against cool ambient recesses; entrances and objectives retain contrast. Tiling requirement: an edge-to-edge repeating texture with no visible border, frame or vignette. Blend repeated stone with decals or modular breakup; test 3x3 and long sightlines. This is a flat albedo material texture, not a scene mockup or a perspective render. Originality: Create a new culture and insignia; avoid named fantasy universes, borrowed maps or recognizable quest icons. Avoid recognizable existing games, brands, characters, logos, watermarks, readable text and copied compositions.",
